ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=kBPcxZNPVmcQ7kNvwG0jmEm&_nc_oc=AdqP2FfCIUtkguTdZaXCfzzaea34zL_JmiX1emToltFOP-lGU3Nhcdkjcn17XYN0ZZk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJ5AaOsn04OZsmxzuHgmaAfi7eTkl4QM3MKBiulAHTeqg&oe=6A9ED6C0"}, {"file_name": "SS img 3.png", "id": "1505980257492182", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819775_1505980260825515_3608218387185725323_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Hc_f6q3E3vQQ7kNvwF2lkyd&_nc_oc=AdrubHZE41EQLZs6L7N0sKPNSeAx0vCsUKOjLeL9XsdlFq6ezCLPIT0nGmvqR0w8Yfs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQL4UK8BwmBBPHxJy2jc-lR3wzQJ5LHGH8J9XtPDKl7Z2w&oe=6A9EA9DE"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Ruins of the Cursed", "keywords": ["VRHorror", "SurvivalHorror", "HauntedFort", "Puzzle", "ZombieHorror"], "long_description": "# **Ruins of the Cursed**\n\n**Dare to enter the ruins where history meets horror.**\n\nRuins of the Cursed is a spine-chilling psychological horror VR experience for Meta Quest. Based on the legends of India's infamous Bhangarh Fort, you are plunged into an unforgiving night where every shadow watches you. Can you break a century-old curse, or will you become another trapped soul?\n\n---\n\n### **Game Features**\n* **Authentic Indian Folklore:** Step into immersive environments inspired by Asia's most haunted ruins.\n* **Tactile VR Survival:** Search for hidden items and solve physics-based environmental puzzles.\n* **Tense Atmosphere:** Terrifying visual scares and 360-degree spatial audio keep you on edge.\n\n---\n\n### **Three Chapters of Terror**\n\n#### **Part I: The Witch Village**\nNavigate eerie outskirts and abandoned mud houses thick with black magic. Search the map for hidden keys to unlock the path forward before the village consumes you.\n\n#### **Part II: Gates of Bhangarh**\nStart at a desolate bus stand and make your way to the fort's massive stone gates. Outsmart characters blocking your path and solve intricate puzzles to unlock the forbidden entryways.\n\n#### **Part III: The Evil Spirit**\nAn aggressive, flying malevolent entity stalks you from the dark skies. Sprint to the central temple, complete the ancient ritual, and use your wits to destroy the creature and break the curse.\n\n---\n\n**Download Ruins of the Cursed today and face the horrors within!**", "short_description": "Enter India's haunted Bhangarh Fort in Ruins of the Cursed. Wield ancient weapons, solve puzzles, and survive demonic spirits in this intense VR horror game!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.devstree.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Devstree IT Services Private Limited", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.devstree.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_FEW", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "644354873106712"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "hi"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1257473590775990"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/585799753_4582942755363467_6291531694928095184_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=do8i4Vh77d0Q7kNvwE1u8sH&_nc_oc=AdoO_hgqqVNcQI7gnGpEG4l5LHVlDm0TzrWNcEIbg0TtBsaWi-xBJi9hzS8c71Awi24&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKosRRg2ArvVsKyk9J5xV1t_PYGSIddTXrPa1Q-EFRkmg&oe=6